{"seq":21,"slug":"functional-analysis","title":"泛函分析","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"泛函分析\">泛函分析</h1><p>泛函分析是把分析学的极限语言搬到无穷维空间的学科。它的出发点很朴素：函数本身就是一种「向量」，可以相加、缩放、谈论长度与距离；可一旦维数变成无穷，有限维线性代数赖以生效的几乎所有直觉都会失效——闭单位球不再紧、有界序列不再有收敛子列、对称算子不再保证有特征向量。泛函分析就是一门系统修复这些裂缝、并在裂缝处发现全新结构的学问。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进，每一层都为下一层备好地基。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是「空间」。我们从<a href=\"spaces/metric-completeness\">度量空间与完备性</a>起步，把距离抽象成三条公理，再用完备性保证极限存在；接着<a href=\"spaces/normed-banach\">赋范空间与巴拿赫空间</a>加入线性与长度，<a href=\"spaces/inner-product-hilbert\">内积与希尔伯特空间</a>再加入角度与正交。三步走完，无穷维空间获得了从距离到几何的完整结构。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是「算子」，研究空间之间的映射。<a href=\"operators/bounded-operators\">有界线性算子</a>统一了连续与不无限放大；<a href=\"operators/three-theorems\">三大基本定理</a>把完备性兑换成关于算子的硬结论；<a href=\"operators/compact-operators\">紧算子</a>则把有限维的好性质以可控方式带回无穷维。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是「对偶与谱」，从空间外部和算子内部两个方向深入。<a href=\"duality-spectrum/dual-hahn-banach\">对偶空间与 Hahn-Banach</a>保证泛函足够丰富；<a href=\"duality-spectrum/weak-convergence-reflexive\">弱收敛与自反性</a>抢救回最优化所需的紧性；<a href=\"duality-spectrum/spectral-theory\">谱理论</a>把特征值理论推广到无穷维，是后续物理应用的语言。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是「应用」，把前三层收束到真实问题。<a href=\"applications/hilbert-orthonormal\">希尔伯特空间与正交基</a>落到傅里叶与压缩，<a href=\"applications/operators-pde\">算子与微分方程</a>落到偏微分方程与有限元，<a href=\"applications/quantum-signal\">量子力学与信号应用</a>落到量子力学、信号处理与机器学习的核方法。</p>\n<p>四条主线的关系是严格的依赖链：没有完备的空间就没有可靠的算子，没有算子的谱就没有量子力学的可观测量，没有对偶的丰富就没有弱收敛与最优化。建议按章节顺序阅读，每篇都假定前面的概念已经就位，并在用到兄弟篇主讲的概念时给出交叉链接。读完会发现，看似抽象的公理，最终都落在了可计算、可工程化的具体结果上。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spaces","title":"度量与赋范空间","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/spaces","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metric-completeness","title":"度量空间与完备性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/spaces/metric-completeness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"normed-banach","title":"赋范空间与巴拿赫空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/spaces/normed-banach"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inner-product-hilbert","title":"内积与希尔伯特空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/spaces/inner-product-hilbert"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"operators","title":"线性算子","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-operators","title":"有界线性算子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/bounded-operators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-theorems","title":"三大基本定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/three-theorems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compact-operators","title":"紧算子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/compact-operators"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"duality-spectrum","title":"对偶与谱","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/duality-spectrum","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dual-hahn-banach","title":"对偶空间与 Hahn-Banach","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/duality-spectrum/dual-hahn-banach"},{"seq":2,"slug":"weak-convergence-reflexive","title":"弱收敛与自反性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/duality-spectrum/weak-convergence-reflexive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-theory","title":"谱理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/duality-spectrum/spectral-theory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hilbert-orthonormal","title":"希尔伯特空间与正交基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications/hilbert-orthonormal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"operators-pde","title":"算子与微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications/operators-pde"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-signal","title":"量子力学与信号应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications/quantum-signal"}]}]}